{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2022-06-13 08:29:00', 'title': 'LARGEST FLOATING SOLAR POWER PLANT IN THE SOUTHEAST AT FORT BRAGG', 'text': "PART OF LARGER ENERGY SERVICES CONTRACT WITH DUKE ENERGY PROJECT ALSO INCLUDES A 2-MW BATTERY \xa0 CHARLOTTE, N.C. , JUNE 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE SOUTHEAST'S LARGEST FLOATING SOLAR PLANT WILL BE PRODUCING POWER SOON AT THE U.S. ARMY'S FORT BRAGG IN NORTH CAROLINA AFTER A MAJOR UTILITY ENERGY SERVICE CONTRACT WITH DUKE ENERGY AND ITS PRIME CONTRACTOR AMERESCO."}